  "ruleText": "He-W 821.03 Administrative Appeals. Individuals denied waivers described in He-W 821.01 and He-W 821.02 may appeal the department of health and human services’ decision and request an administrative appeal pursuant to He-C 200.\n\nSource. #9136, eff 4-22-08; ss by #11058, INTERIM, eff 3-24-16, EXPIRED: 9-20-16\n\nNew. #12217, eff 6-22-17 (See Revision Note at Part heading for He-W 821)\n\nPARTS He-W 822 and He-W 823 - RESERVED",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w800.html"
